ego-verified-actions is an independent companion skill for ego-lite 0.4.7.4.

Opaque candidate keys, probability-distribution validation, and
re-observation after each action follow the correctness discipline in
https://github.com/phd-peter/ego-jev (MIT). No source was copied from
that repository, from romaluev/jev-ego, or from browser-use/jev-ultrafast.

TypeSafe Jev is a hosted model; this repo does not include model weights.
ego lite / ego-browser is a separate product (Citro Labs).
